  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Barcode Generator is a lightweight and feature-rich control for rendering industry-standard 1D and 2D barcodes in web applications. It supports a wide range of barcode symbologies including QR Code, Data Matrix, Code 128, Code 39, EAN, UPC, PDF417, and more. The control provides options to customize barcode width, height, foreground and background colors, text display, and quiet zones, making it suitable for inventory management, product labeling, and retail applications built on ASP.NET Core.",
